{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52433","headline":"回波乐 七十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前死未长别，後来亦非久（项校「非久亲」）。\n新坟影旧塚，相续似鱼鳞。\n义陵秋节远，曾逢几个春。\n万刼同今日，一种化微尘。\n定知见土里，还待（一作「得」）昔时人。\n频闻积代骨，爲坑埋我身。\n（〖1〗项谓此首爲北周释亡名《五盛阴诗》之改作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}